Code cache (FEX_ENABLECODECACHINGWIP=1, FEXOfflineCompiler64.exe) on Apple Silicon: the offline
compiler loads its config before logging (it crashed on a null config layer) and gets the MAP_JIT
write switch; relocating cached code and copying it into the ARM64EC code buffer run in a
JITWriteScope. Loading a cache still crashes at the first cached block, see docs/neutron.md.

